# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Viet Heritage — Tour Planner (Gemini API)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The Gemini API key is held SERVER-SIDE in the FastAPI backend,
# so it is never exposed to the browser. The planner page calls
# POST /api/v1/chat, which the backend proxies to Google Gemini.
#
# HOW TO SET UP:
#
# 1. Get a free Google Gemini API key (starts with "AIza..."):
#    https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# 2. Put it in the BACKEND env file (not here):
#      backend/.env  →  GEMINI_API_KEY="AIza..."
#
# 3. Install backend deps and run it:
#      cd backend
#      pip install -r requirements.txt
#      uvicorn app.main:app --reload
#
# 4. Open the planner in your browser:
#      http://127.0.0.1:8000/planner.html
#
# If the backend is not running, the planner falls back to a
# local demo mode so the page still works.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE